<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Charter One started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Charter One started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley has initiated coverage of Charter One Financial Inc with an outperform rating.</p>
<p>-- No other information was immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares of the Cleveland-based financial holding company closed at 44-7/8 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
